==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|ei}}, a common [[interjection]] used, among other things, as a [[vocative]] particle. The word is thus of native origin, though in contemporary colloquial German it may well have been reinforced by synonymous {{etyl|tr|de}} {{m|tr|ey}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɛɪ̯/|lang=de}}

===Interjection===
{{head|de|interjection}}

# {{lb|de|colloquial}} {{non-gloss definition|used to call someone’s attention}}
#: '''''Ey''' Peter, komm mal kucken, was hier auf dem Schild steht!''
#:: '''Hey''' Peter, come and see what it says on this sign!

